  <p class="rules"><b>Easy:</b> clearer descriptions, pick from 4 options, 4 hints, 100 pts. <b>Medium:</b> vague descriptions, type your guess, 3 hints, 200 pts. <b>Hard:</b> painfully basic descriptions, 2 hints, 300 pts. Each hint costs 20% of the points. You get 3 typed guesses; small typos are accepted.</p>
</div>

